~ start

Ollie: Up through the ceiling! Dodong, come on!
Dodong: I can't... my leg...
Ollie: Let me see.
There is a deep cut along his leg, and it won't stop bleeding.

if Inventory.has_item("medkit")
	Ollie: The medkit. I knew I'd need it.
	Ollie: Hold still. This is going to sting.
else
	Ollie: I don't have anything to wrap it with...
	Ollie: Please, Dodong. Stay with me.

Dodong: Ollie, it's so dark up here.
Ollie: I know. I'm right here.

=> END